"title_0" = "The state of affairs at the moment";
"title_1" = "How does the given situation develop";
"title_2" = "Hint, help in this situation";
"title_3" = "Where did it all start";
"title_4" = "Description of the past";
"title_5" = "Estimated future";
"title_6" = "Your attitude to the current situation";
"title_7" = "What surrounds you";
"title_8" = "Your hopes and dreams regarding the question asked";
"title_9" = "The final map, how will everything turn out";

"fool_financial" = "The card hints at travel or carefree behavior. Rejoice in every event and unusual occasion, and also strive to discover something new for yourself every day. Your situation is either in the past already, or requires that you leave it. The card says that now is the time for you to start everything from scratch and in a new way.";
"magicianCard_financial" = "This card may indicate that this situation is now completely in your power. To achieve your goal, you need to be an enterprising, qualified professional, ready to discard everything superfluous and focus on the main thing, choose the only right path, using all the necessary methods, means and forces. If there are curly cards nearby that describe not you, but another person, then the card says that it is he who controls the situation.";
"highpriestessCard_financial" = "Promising cases await you in the situation under consideration, which may be related to scientific activities and education. Just don't force things. It is necessary to take any action only when everything will turn out favorably. Many moments of the situation in which you find yourself are hidden from your eyes and full of secrets and mysteries that it is not time to reveal yet. Try to hear the voice of your soul and intuition, logic will not help you here. Also, the card can indicate magical effects on what is happening." ;
"empressCard_financial" = "In a situation that worries you, new ideas are waiting for you, innovation, revival, a great undertaking, many opportunities for further development, good rewards, a creative process, a willingness to take care of a trusted person. In any case, your situation has a huge potential for growth and your personal development, so treat it correctly and take on its resolution, then it will be solved safely for you.";
"emperorCard_financial" = "The emperor indicates authority, an influential position in society, a leadership position, great power, first roles. Active actions to stabilize the situation, the introduction of all kinds of quality improvement procedures, performance measurement. Therefore, depending on the situation under consideration, it either depends on a decisive person with power who sets certain limits and restrictions, or your volitional actions can lead to its successful resolution.";
"hierophantCard_financial" = "Now is a good time to accumulate knowledge. You strive to find the truth, but you are stopped by the need to follow prohibitions and traditional values. In the situation you are considering, either participation in rituals or communication with a spiritual mentor is expected. This is the right path for you, but remember that the search for truth may not bring anything in return - be tolerant, honest and lenient, gain experience. Even if you do not have a specific result and complete the situation, you will gain more - an increase in your spiritual level and peace.";
"lovesCard_financial" = "In the situation you are considering, the card will help you make the right decision, which will be wise. Thanks to this card, you can count on business partnerships and teamwork. Only mutual assistance is visible on the map, no projects and leadership are foreseen. Choose the right solution for your situation through the prompts of your heart, the mind can aggravate your situation. Try to proceed from the impulses of your soul.";
"chariotCard_financial" = "The card indicates that you are ready to take risks for the sake of success, career and achievement of your goals. You perform new tasks for yourself, gain new experience, and possibly completely change your field of activity. With this card, it is important for you to be vigilant and control the situation in which you find yourself. It is your will, efforts and self-discipline that will solve difficulties and problematic moments. Don't expect help or support here. Only your enterprise, firmness and confidence will help you in resolving.";
"strengthCard_financial" = "The card portends you success in the situation you are considering, to which you will owe your own qualities and efforts. No matter how difficult the circumstances that have developed for you, you cannot solve them abruptly and persistently. Only your inner will, calmness and wise approach allow you to turn the situation in your favor and defeat difficulties without struggle and cardinal efforts.";
"hermitCard_financial" = "The card draws your attention to the fact that you should try your hand at mentoring. You need to consider the clarity of fulfilling all the obligations you have taken on in order to achieve the success you are moving towards. The situation in which you find yourself requires you to rethink your life values and realize that you live your own life? This is a very important period for you, because only by looking into the very depths of yourself you will find your true path and solution to the situation.";
"wheelOfFortune_financial" = "In the situation that has developed around you, rational reasoning and understanding of the whole situation on your part is necessary. It has a fateful or karmic character for you and is a consequence of the decisions you made in the past. In no case do not give in to emotions and conflicts. You will have to make a decision in any matters quickly enough, but try to do it as carefully as possible. The most correct idea for you will be the one that first comes to your mind and will talk about the implementation of your plans, but you will need to give this first decision a thoughtful form.";
"justiceCard_financial" = "No matter what situation you find yourself in, your merits will certainly be recognized, you will receive an award, even more than you imagined. The most important thing for you now is honesty, justice and an objective assessment in relation to yourself, to others and to the world as a whole. The final decision of your life circumstances will be fair: you will be given back the debt, provided with a full report or all the necessary documentation, information, if the question concerns documentary cases.";
"hangedCard_financial" = "Whatever situation you find yourself in, the Hanged Man suggests that you slow down, temporarily do nothing, but spend time rethinking the situation and finding new, unusual ways to resolve it. In any case, the situation will not be resolved quickly and it is not in your power to complete it yet, the time has not yet come. It is for you a kind of life lesson that you need to realize and learn, having made a significant experience for yourself. Even if the current situation seems unbearable and painful to you, it is very valuable for your future.";
"deathCard_financial" = "This card can tell you that the situation in which you find yourself has either already ended or is ending. It can be perceived by you quite painfully due to the fact that you have to part with something that was very important for you and has become familiar. But it does not bring you further growth and development, circumstances could drive you into a state of swamp and no longer serve your interests. It's time for you to move on and after the darkest time of the day, a new dawn awaits you.";
"moderationCard_financial" = "Moderation recommends that you treat the situation that you have developed in a harmonious and measured way. it may indicate that the situation could have dragged on sufficiently and come into balance in the context of the concept of everyday life, which could tire you a little. In any case, show your friendliness, you will be able to perceive with dignity the opinions and conversations from the outside and find compromises. You will have great relationships with people if you show the position of a peacemaker. You will be able to overcome the moments that disturb you precisely thanks to your thoughtfulness and inner balance.";
"devilCard_financial" = "The map in the situation that you are currently living in indicates to you the presence of intrigues, corrupt practices, illegal transactions and, in principle, a focus on material goods and benefits. The devil may warn you of a tempting offer in which you can commit an illegal or immoral act. It is possible that sources of income hidden from others may be found in a situation, or groups of people connected together by common selfish goals.";
"towerCard_financial" = "Speaking about the situation that is happening now in your life, it can be described in one word - collapse. The card indicates total destruction, loss, the collapse of what you have been building in your life for a long time. This may be the loss of a job, and the divorce of a long-term, formerly strong union, and the loss of a loved one. In general, the situation is really terrible and quite difficult. The main thing in this for everyone is to understand that higher powers had a hand in it in order to pull you out of oppressive circumstances that affect you into the abyss and do not develop you, do not lead to growth. And having survived these destructions, you will definitely see the light at the end of the tunnel and your life will become much brighter than the previous one.";
"starCard_financial" = "Whatever situation you are in now, the light of the sun will surely rise for you and you should only hope for the best. If you are sick or a loved one dear to you, your health will definitely improve and the sick person will definitely recover. If there was a crisis in your life, then expect improvements and improvement of the situation. The card basically says that all your hopes and best expectations will come true. Therefore, feel free to make a wish and plan your bright future. The map is the light at the end of the tunnel for you, a kind of beacon.";
"moonCard_financial" = "The moon can speak of your fears regarding your situation due to incompetence and lack of experience. It may turn out that there is no reason for fear at all. Also, your situation does not give confidence in the future. There may be many hidden moments and secrets in it that can harm you. There are many circumstances associated with deceit and disorder in it. The card may hint at fraud, organized and planned intrigues, as well as the presence of hidden circumstances in your situation.";
"sunCard_financial" = "No matter how difficult the situation in which you find yourself, the Sun card helps you move forward and promises clarity and flowering, which will help you achieve success and career growth. Any of your undertakings will be very promising. You know how to do your job silently, slowly, without looking back at the past, as well as perceive life circumstances positively and hoping for the best. It is these qualities that will help you solve your difficulties and reach success.";
"doomsdayCard_financial" = "The Last Judgment card tells you that in the near future your plans, which you are actively striving for, are being realized. Higher forces have intervened in the situation in which you find yourself and are leading you on a path that is favorable for you, to the Renaissance. You are going through a moment of renewal and healing in your life. You can make your dream come true or you can achieve your goal. Your financial situation will improve: you can get a new position, or you can start your own business successfully or pass exams successfully.";
"worldCard_financial" = "The World card promises dizzying success and a successful conclusion to the situation that you are going through. Thanks to it, you will answer many of your internal questions and everything in your head will fall into place, as in principle later in life. You will achieve everything that you only dreamed of. All your plans will come true, any of your projects will have a happy ending. You can indeed safely trust your views under the circumstances, and hardly anyone else can do it better than you. The card may also recommend travel and recuperation.";

//Figure

"pageOfPentacles_financial" = "If you suddenly want to work with your hands: plant a garden, create something or produce new products - this is not a manifestation of empty dreams, but a very specific goal. You can achieve it if you put in enough effort. In any case, physical labor will help to switch from heavy thoughts. The Page of Pentacles also serves as a warning to you: in the near future, be as careful as possible in the documentation where you have to sign. Absorb new experience and any information that will be useful in the future. Also, the card can mark the appearance in your environment of a man, closed, with a bias towards introversion and quite cautious.";
"pageOfSwords_financial" = "You have problems in relationships with colleagues at work, superiors. True, the interpretation is ambiguous, much depends on the essence of the matter. This can be expressed in disobedience to superiors, a quarrel in the team, and possibly in the form of a struggle for a position. Only all this is not good, since you can earn a reprimand from the management, and as a rule, this will be an undeserved reprimand. You may be worried about your new projects. But do not forget about creation, because even in a problem situation, you can disrupt the normal course of things and bring something good into things, raising them to a new qualitative level. If we talk about a person in this situation, then he is rather cold, impatient, arrogant and inflated and can aggravate circumstances.";
"pageOfWands_financial" = "You have to do a difficult but interesting job that will bring recognition and pleasure. A new job will allow you to fully show your talents. Sometimes this card indicates that success is very likely, but it is better to get an authoritative patron. It can also be a signal that you should act strictly according to the law to achieve success, taking into account even the smallest nuances.";
"pageOfCups_financial" = "Your intuition will be well developed. You will feel well the profitability of business and the prospects of projects. New offers will not only be a good future, but will also be remembered for pleasant moments and impressions. You will be praised, thanked, your work and talents will be deservedly recognized. The card indicates that you may be offered a promotion, you will get close to an influential person.";
"knightOfPentacles_financial" = "Under the influence of this card, you will show business acumen. You will systematically achieve your goals, solve everyday issues, and feel confident in the future. Your efforts will be productive, you will be able to use them correctly. In general, you will be given almost all professional cases. Speaking about the situation that worries you, we can say that it is quite protracted and viscous, but in the end you will remain in the black thanks to your diligence and concentration.";
"knightOfSwords_financial" = "The Knight of Swords speaks of ill-conceived decisions, instantaneous conclusions, inconstancy, and the lack of a clear understanding of the situation. If you're having trouble, you're probably creating it yourself. This may be due to your character flaws or lack of experience. Or a man with a rather arrogant temperament and a belligerent attitude towards you intervenes in your situation, who can challenge you and, in principle, those around you.";
"knightOfWands_financial" = "The card speaks of new opportunities and the need to realize your original ideas. It's a good time for you to change jobs. Business trips, travel and a strong marriage are possible, so be prepared for this.";
"knightOfCups_financial" = "The card may indicate a new meeting for you, which will be very fruitful and may end in a stormy romance. Or it will be your old friend, who will bring with him new pleasant sensations, experiences, surprises. It is very likely that the upcoming meeting will not offend you, you will not lose anything, on the contrary, you will gain. This person may make you an offer that is hard to refuse, so don't refuse.";
"kingOfPentacles_financial" = "Whatever situation you consider, the card speaks of a fairly stable state of affairs, that everything will be resolved in a positive way for you and will give good results and results. Also, the card may indicate that in a mysterious situation you need to rely on the firm shoulder of a spiritual mentor, wise with life experience, he can give valuable advice to resolve it.";
"kingOfSwords_financial" = "The card may indicate help from an influential person, good job prospects, successful negotiations, successful development of new experience. You will have the ability to persuade. And in some moments, perhaps, you will be set up quite belligerently and strictly on the situation.";
"kingOfWands_financial" = "Your luck is not far off. It's your time to act. You can start to implement your innovative ideas, show imagination and creativity. No obstacles will prevent you from achieving the desired results. The mysterious situation is completely in your power.";
"kingOfCups_financial" = "The card speaks of the opportunity to soon meet with a very sensitive and attentive interlocutor who will listen to your problem and give wise advice, will provide all possible assistance. Or it may be that someone from a close circle will tell you how to solve a problem that bothers you.";
"queenOfPentacles_financial" = "You are probably a reasonable and organized person. You will be able to show your skill, insight and creative approach to solving professional problems and show a high level of your qualifications. Here we are not talking about great ambitions, it is more important for you that in your affairs there is order and reliability in everything, confidence in the future. You will be able to solve the situation thanks to your stability and concentration.";
"queenOfSwords_financial" = "The Queen of Swords says that in many situations you will show your competence, excellent experience and diplomacy and self-confidence. You can truly be called a good negotiator. You can explain complex processes and concepts. When it comes to choosing a profession, then you know for sure that it will be mental work, where you can reveal yourself to the maximum. This card speaks of honest and fair leadership and independent, independent subordinates who know their stuff.";
"queenOfWands_financial" = "The Queen of Wands tells you about the intense dynamics and swiftness of the situation being analyzed. You need to resolve any issues quickly. A promising future and professional self-realization await you, but only if you adequately fulfill your obligations, and until the last moment you will be confident in your abilities. You should not be afraid of responsibility in the activity in which you are well versed. You will have a lot of interesting and profitable ideas that are successfully implemented. It is possible that you will be able to express yourself in creative activities.";
"queenOfCups_financial" = "If a bad event happened in your life, you should definitely analyze the situation and answer yourself the question of why this happened. With what exactly is this connected: with personal qualities or with external circumstances. In any case, you should rely on your intuition here. Your subconscious will soon begin to actively give signals in the form of signs, dreams, or insights. Do not neglect them, they will benefit you and help you make the right decision.";

//Numeral

"aceOfPentacles_financial" = "Start new business, they will be successful, and promise a good income. The moment is favorable for the implementation of those plans that have long been conceived. There is a possibility that a very expensive and valuable gift awaits you. If funding is required to support an important project, then you should not worry, your business will be funded. For the work done with high quality, you will definitely receive a reward, perhaps even more than you agreed with the customer before. If you are still a student, then the lasso foreshadows the successful completion of a thesis, practice, exam.";
"aceOfSwords_financial" = "Very soon you will start a new interesting project that will capture all your consciousness. It will appear not just like a gift of fate. This is a reward to you for the nerves, time and energy spent in a serious conflict. When storm clouds appear on your path in the form of huge problems, the main thing is to maintain discipline, be decisive, do not hesitate. Do not be afraid to make a mistake, only if it is not fatal, this will be a great lesson. In any case, everything negative will lead to something new and insanely interesting. Concentrate all your attention on the goal, and a positive result will not be long in coming.";
"aceOfWands_financial" = "You should not be afraid of difficulties - your time has come! You can safely implement your plans. The time has come for your disclosure of your own I. This applies to all areas of your life. Right now you will begin the path to yourself - the best. You will finally understand your life purpose, you will be able to realize your talents. Any work for you will be successful during this period. If we are talking about professional activities, then it is time for career growth. Perhaps you will receive a difficult task, and successfully complete it. The motivation will be quite strong. The authorities will not disregard this fact. A bonus or a new position - that's what you can expect. Luck is on your side! The card predicts a successful transition from a stable situation to rapid development.";
"aceOfCups_financial" = "In a positive aspect, the card indicates some new experiences for you in life that relate to the emotional sphere. Most likely, you will soon have an engagement, pregnancy, or an important event that entails a range of feelings. If you already have a relationship with a person, then they will definitely move to a new stage. If you have a desire to give birth to a child, then success awaits you in this matter. Often Arkan indicates a pleasant and welcome gift from a loved one. The Ace of Cups in the layout of the situation is a symbol of beginnings in love affairs.";
"twoOfPentacles_financial" = "The card may suggest a more promising change of position for you, and in business, stabilization, restructuring and dynamics. A person will want to earn money from two jobs at once in order to have two sources of income, and he will succeed. He, in principle, is satisfied with his activities, although he will experience a share of fuss and discomfort. Will be competent and agile enough to deal with a large volume of tasks and solve most problems. You need to think about all your actions on your own in peace and quiet. You do not need to particularly trust business partners and colleagues, they can be unreliable, and their assurances are unstable. The Two of Pentacles rewards a person with a surge of strength and a sense of freedom from unnecessary worries. This state very well helps him to do his job perfectly.";
"twoOfSwords_financial" = "The card says that you can skillfully resolve conflict situations using your analytical skills and charm. To get the amount of money you want, you must consider additional types of income. In the near future there will be all the possibilities for this. The period of activity begins. Feel free to use your creativity. Perhaps someone will offer you additional work. To achieve success in your career will help you: honesty, diligence, endurance, high motivation. There is even a chance that soon it will be possible to take a leadership position.";
"twoOfWands_financial" = "In a situation, you will face fierce competition and a desire to strengthen your previously won positions. You should prepare for difficult professional tasks in which it is important to show your personal enthusiasm and activity. You will hope for the best, it will seem to you that everything planned will come true soon, even though you will experience unconscious anxiety and excitement. Regardless of the circumstances, you should act promptly in all situations. And this is what the Two of Wands card requires of you. You can’t doubt for a second what you are doing, and you shouldn’t think for a long time.";
"twoOfCups_financial" = "A successful and promising business partnership is expected for you. You will succeed at work in many situations, especially when you do your job together with the team, and not alone. You will definitely find mutual understanding with your work colleagues, even if you have appeared in this team quite recently. Colleagues will respect you and set you as an example. If we are talking about foreign partners, then here you will not be equal. You expect successful negotiations with partners who will be interested in further cooperation. In creative affairs, you will show your aesthetic sense, and excellent prospects for the implementation of the artistic direction.";
"threeOfPentacles_financial" = "If the situation you are considering concerns a career or business, then the card hints at success that is not too fast, but true for you. You are expected to increase strictly on schedule, without acceleration, but without failures. In financial matters, the Three of Pentacles is a good sign. It does not promise super profits, but confidently promises the absence of losses, losses and unforeseen expenses. When dealt with health, the card speaks of good physical shape. Women may take it as a recommendation to do the same long-planned cosmetic surgery.";
"threeOfSwords_financial" = "If we are talking about how the situation at work will develop, we must prepare for trouble. It could be layoffs or downsizing. Conflicts with colleagues and superiors will inflame the situation in the team. On this basis, many ill-wishers can appear. If you are the owner of a company (or hold a leadership position), the card predicts that you may lose your position and influence. Unsuccessful transactions, huge monetary losses and other misfortunes will have to be endured somehow.";
"threeOfWands_financial" = "The Three of Wands is a good omen. The implementation of plans will depend on the efforts that you make for this. If you try, Fortune will definitely help you achieve the desired results. The Three of Wands are the first successful steps in your life. Due to the fact that life experience is not enough, you make many mistakes. Every person in this world comes to grow spiritually and strive for perfection. With age, both wisdom and experience will come, because you have chosen the right guidelines. You will soon have the beginning of a successful period for the implementation of creative ideas. This is the first success. Sometimes the card indicates the first test before further successful events. You can safely voice your ideas to the authorities.";
"threeOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates the holidays in your life, which must be celebrated with loved ones. After all, the reason, as a rule, is very significant: a wedding, the birth of children, graduation from a school or university, getting a new position. However, after the holidays, everyday work is waiting for you again, so you should not get carried away, everything has its own measure.";
"fourOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates that everything will go as planned, and your goal will be achieved as planned and on time. Possible small overlays will be easily eliminated, since the position is completely controlled by you. If it was about work, the card can be interpreted as a stable position, quiet but reliable success, material well-being. She does not recommend changing jobs - you can expect success in an existing one. At the same time, the card indicates that in this situation you are only interested in the pragmatic, material side of the issue - it is unlikely that you will do something really significant.";
"fourOfSwords_financial" = "The card says that there may not be enough time to implement your plans. Perhaps you are not liked in the team, and gossip is weaved around him. Even those colleagues who seem to be friends are somewhat jealous of him, and not sincere towards you. The situation may reach such a point that you may even have to leave work in order to avoid excessive negativity towards yourself and a critical state.";
"fourOfWands_financial" = "This card says that the happiest time has come for you. You don’t have to worry about anything, because everything in your life is working out in the best way. It is possible that at work you have been appointed to a leadership position or this is being prepared for you. In personal relationships, marriage is possible. There is a high chance of winning a solid amount in the lottery. Perhaps the debtor will return you such a large amount of money that you can even spend on buying a home.";
"fourOfCups_financial" = "The card suggests that you should do a soul-searching. Perhaps what is considered very important for you at this stage of life, what frustrates and depresses you the most, is actually not so necessary for you in life. Surrounding people try to help, but help is not accepted, you withdraw into yourself, renounce everything that exists. This condition can border on a mental disorder.";
"fiveOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates to you an unstable, unreliable position. If we are talking about a business situation, it can be interpreted as some kind of event, unforeseen and beyond your control, with equal success it can lead to career growth and dismissal. She also indicates that you have to go through some event that you are afraid of (an exam, an interview, a move, a transition to a new position). It is not worth interpreting the card as an omen of failure - it only says that you are wary of the upcoming event, but it is not necessarily really so difficult for you. In addition, instability is good because it cannot last long. The Five of Pentacles indicates that all problems will be resolved soon (but it's up to you whether it's good or bad).";
"fiveOfSwords_financial" = "The Five of Swords does not carry a good meaning for your situation, it can affect any area of ​​life, including work. Gossip, intrigues, discussions behind your back can come from your colleagues. If you are a person in a leadership position, the card warns of a possible imminent bankruptcy, a desire to sit you down, a complete mess among the team. You need to change your behavior towards subordinates, and then the situation can normalize.";
"fiveOfWands_financial" = "The situations that this card falls into are often associated with conflicts, intersection of interests, difficulties in solving problems. You may have conflicts with colleagues at work that lead to the necessary changes. There may also be fundamental disagreements in which no one wants to meet, as well as noisy demonstrative conflicts. Nevertheless, such a stubborn struggle pushes for productive actions and the achievement of new heights. The struggle is transferred to health as a result, the temperature rises or minor inflammations occur. Also in the situation there may be a struggle for who will be the leader. If we are talking about relationships in a couple, then it is based on rivalry, because of this, conflicts arise. A constant struggle, the result of which can be the transition of relations to a new level, or their complete collapse.";
"fiveOfCups_financial" = "The card is considered problematic, it can indicate failed projects, broken promises and losses. You have a rather indecisive, changeable character. You probably tend to avoid problems, even in a period of difficulties and obstacles, instead of solving them. But troubles can expect you on the road, and at the workplace, and even in some household chores. In addition, you do not want to be content with a tit in your hands, and you are chasing illusions to no avail. The card carries false promises, failed projects, impracticable undertakings, unprofitable enterprises, breaches of contracts. This could even include failing an exam. Try to build for yourself goals and objectives that are more realistic and achievable.";
"sixOfPentacles_financial" = "Perhaps a pleasant surprise awaits you, a gift from a loved one. At the household level, you can be approved for a loan, mortgage, new career and business prospects will appear. Your debtors, as if by magic, will begin to repay their debts. In the event that you have a deal planned, it will end successfully, it will not be postponed to another date, it will be easy to find a compromise with a partner. If at this moment in life you need material assistance, you will receive it soon.";
"sixOfSwords_financial" = "The card says that a calm happy time is coming for you. During this period, important life-changing decisions can be made. Communication with friends and acquaintances will be beneficial, among which potential partners for business or some business may appear. Favorable time to learn a new job. The card says that everything can be achieved by your active actions. A new vision of the situation will make you want to change your lifestyle, and you should not be afraid of change. Perhaps, in a new profession, you maximize the creative abilities inherent in nature.";
"sixOfWands_financial" = "Deserved career success for a job well done that will lead to a raise or promotion. In studies, for example, when defending a diploma, everything will go smoothly for you and there is nowhere better, you will receive the highest scores from teachers. Your long-term project will finally come to its logical conclusion. When all problems are resolved, a journey awaits you, perhaps not to distant lands, but definitely full of new experiences, giving inspiration and impetus for ideas. In work, if you need to sign an agreement from partners, this will be done, especially if a lot of effort has been put into this. The card also warns you that you will have to make a serious and urgent decision in order to resolve things in a favorable way. Don't worry, you're on the right side.";
"sixOfCups_financial" = "The card gives you pleasure from the activities that you do. You have a rich creative potential, and the realization of your ideas is not far off, there are all the prerequisites for this. You should expect pleasant projects, assignments and tasks. You will be capable of good deeds, show your care and support to those people who will need it. And you will do it from a pure heart, with good intentions. You will devote a lot of time to your work activity, creativity, cooperation. You can also return to those cases that were pending and unfinished, and their implementation was only discussed. You will get satisfaction from your work, and all thanks to the huge number of ideas and ideas.";
"sevenOfPentacles_financial" = "The card is interpreted as a successful resolution of your affairs, despite the constant doubt in your own abilities, a large number of obstacles and difficulties on the way to achieving your goal. If your subconscious tells you that now is not the best time to decide or start something, stop and rest, pause. This will bring your thoughts back to normal, perhaps a brilliant idea will appear on how to resolve this or that issue.";
"sevenOfSwords_financial" = "The Seven of Swords shows that the situation has become unbearable for you, you no longer understand what is happening, you are trying to deceive others and yourself in order to somehow delay the resolution of the issue. And yet you will have to solve the situation, and the card says that you will have to make a decision very quickly, and it will be unpopular. Also, the card may indicate that there may be manipulation and deception around you, there are people whose intentions are unclean regarding you.";
"sevenOfWands_financial" = "There are some complexities in your situation, which are created either by people from outside, or by your own far-fetched problems. One way or another, but the resolution of the situation requires certain qualities of yours: firmness of character, perseverance and faith in yourself and your strengths. Moreover, your situation is quite favorable, and you will emerge victorious from it.";
"sevenOfCups_financial" = "You see the situation as if in rose-colored glasses, which prevents you from making the right decision. You do not always see the situation from all sides and cannot prevent negative consequences. Often your situations are not very favorable due to the fact that you simply do not want to see her problematic, referring to what is happening with excessive frivolity.";
"eightOfPentacles_financial" = "The Eight of Pentacles promises you a very favorable outcome, but on the condition that you do not let everything take its course, but work hard and persistently for the result. Most importantly, don't give up and don't give up on your goals. The situation will not develop very quickly, but still it will bring you positive results, even if it will be difficult for you to achieve them. At the household level, the card indicates reasonable savings, since home improvement and housekeeping are ahead. At the same time, this card does not speak of lack of money, the financial condition is stable within the framework of the salary received. It does not promise large incomes, but it does not speak of need.";
"eightOfSwords_financial" = "The Eight of Swords says that your situation has stopped at a certain stage and it cannot be moved, and you are to blame for what is happening yourself. You do not see any development, you are constrained by circumstances and your own attitude to everything that happens, you feel danger, which is why you are trying to simply run away from resolving the issue. The situation requires you to take a decisive step, but you cannot do it because of your own impotence. Besides, you are not free in your actions. If the situation involves some kind of risk, especially if it is associated with various violations of the law, then in it the card predicts a disastrous outcome: there is a high probability of falling under restriction of freedom. This may consist both in limiting possible actions, and in detention by law enforcement agencies.";
"eightOfWands_financial" = "The card tells you that all the processes to resolve the situation have already been launched, you just have to accept everything that happens, quickly respond to events, and the result will be positive for you. In no case should you hesitate and be inactive, as this can lead to losses. The map shows that the situation you are looking at will be decided in the very near future. This may happen unexpectedly for you or by methods unplanned by you. You need to be prepared for the surprises of fate. If you look at a long-term situation, then you can say that the time has come for its decisive phase. The card indicates that the situation will be resolved favorably in any case, if there are no negative cards next to it. They will tell you in which direction to expect a catch.";
"eightOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates to you the need to change something in life, to look for other opportunities and goals. You probably have well-established life tendencies, a certain income and profession, make some plans, but a sudden crisis has come in your life, and you are forced to look for a way out of this situation. You will have to give up something, change your goals, and sometimes even your profession, in order to adequately get out of this crisis. It should be understood that the time has come for you to make new decisions, since the old ones will no longer lead to a positive result. You must make a confident decision not to be tempted by the ghostly ideas of the past. This requires some effort, so we can definitely say that the situation is currently going through a difficult turning point.";
"nineOfPentacles_financial" = "The card tells you about a favorable resolution of cases, and you will get tremendous pleasure from this. The situation will resolve itself in the best possible way for you, allowing you to enjoy the result. You will easily achieve your goals, achieve everything that was planned. At the household level, the card indicates to you an increase in the family budget, receiving unexpected rewards, winning or gaining an inheritance. You can also talk about serious purchases, up to the acquisition of real estate. If we are talking about planning some events for you, then they will be successful for you and will bring personal satisfaction to what has been done.";
"nineOfSwords_financial" = "The Nine of Swords shows that at the moment you are powerless to change anything. This is due to your internal problems: self-doubt, doubts, fears, negative thoughts. Everything that happens brings you into a painful state, and you are still fixated on your experiences. In everyday situations, the card means loss - money, something important and worthwhile. Coping with these losses will be extremely difficult for you. For some time you have to endure a nervous shock, which can be aggravated by self-flagellation, guilt and sometimes shame for what happened.";
"nineOfWands_financial" = "The Nine of Wands indicates that your situation requires perseverance and the ability to stand up for yourself. Most likely, you have experienced pain and resentment in the past. This put you on the defensive. At the moment, you will have to defend your positions, although in general the situation is relatively stable. You only need to overcome small obstacles, make a competent decision, and the situation will be resolved favorably for you. Indecision or unwillingness to adhere to your own beliefs can prevent you from achieving your goal. But this will not happen if you turn to your willpower. You need to be prepared to make unpopular decisions, but the outcome of the situation will depend on the flexibility of your thinking. It is very important to prevent the recurrence of problems left in your past.";
"nineOfCups_financial" = "Whatever situation you consider, this card always promises its successful completion. It can be resolved with some difficulties, which the cards next to it will certainly tell, but sooner or later it will come to success. People around you are very favorably inclined, you can realize everything that you have in mind, counting on help from all sides. With this card, almost no special efforts are required, since fate presents you with various gifts. Knock and the doors will be opened for you. This card is very good for people who complete some project or grandiose work. It will mean that you are just waiting for a triumphant success that you did not even count on.";
"tenOfPentacles_financial" = "The Ten of Pentacles tells you about a favorable resolution, and you will not be alone in this situation. Relatives will come to your aid. No one says that the situation will be resolved with one movement of the hand, but even if it continues for some time, the outcome of it will still please you. At the household level, the card speaks of a consistently high financial position, which is completely safe, so you can safely make serious purchases or invest in tempting projects. In all endeavors you will be successful.";
"tenOfSwords_financial" = "The card shows you a stalemate that no one and nothing can change. Usually this kind of situation is called karmic, like the card itself. Whatever you do, but until you go through the situation to the end, you can not do anything. I must admit that in this situation you should not count on someone else's help. Those who want to help can and will, but the best thing they can do is to be there and only empathize. To intervene in the situation they will not be given forces that are not subject to man. At the household level, the map shows losses, sometimes very serious. And, as a rule, in several areas at once. It can unsettle you, empty your soul, make you feel dead to the outside world.";
"tenOfWands_financial" = "The situation that this card characterizes is considered complex, problematic, and virtually unsolvable. It is accompanied by certain events that hinder the development of your situation, hinder its resolution. The card may indicate too high expectations from the business you have started, and, as a rule, they arise due to an incorrect assessment of the prospects. You, not seeing the full picture, have taken on certain obligations that have become a heavy burden for you. Your strength and capabilities are running out, and there is no end in sight to the situation. The positive thing is that now you have enough strength to achieve success, but you will have to work very hard, and, most importantly, do not give up halfway. And yet it should be remembered that each person has a limit of possibilities.";
"tenOfCups_financial" = "The card says that at present all forces are involved in resolving your situation, which will lead to a favorable result. It shows the successful completion of your work, fruitful work, chores that will be crowned with success. This is always an auspicious card, as it signifies triumph. It is favorable in any household situation. She can tell you about the acquisition of real estate, as well as receiving a donation from close relatives or an inheritance. The card can indicate that the situation is happening either in the house itself, or is directly related to it. If you treat your office like a home, spend a huge amount of time in it and cherish it, the map will point to it too.";
